      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "麦昆跟帝王都已经是以\n“知名赛马娘”的身份\n在各处活跃的人了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "989bb886966e56f5ad9a5746d0b9f85e7ec414ee332b192d43e9f8d328e71341",
