      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天啊，起鸡皮疙瘩了……！\n我看了一场好夸张的比赛！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9660533737b4f62ad4fd773f73b0c5860ac0ef41c5fa0a5900cce8175c519be",
