      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身为她的训练员，\n只要是对她将来有帮助的事情，\n我都愿意竭尽所能地去协助她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "181f663576b4725511c8b4288461f63eb5437a8dfa8ce33b11abab43a9439cad",
